      "content": "but resting just feels like delaying the inevitable. i'll wake up tomorrow and the debt will still be there, the failure will still be there, and i'll still be the same person who can't keep up. it's like being stuck in a loop of suffering. i keep thinking about how much easier it would be if the loop just... stopped. if there was just silence. do you think it's even rational to keep trying when the math just doesn't add up anymore?",
